// UnlitGeneric and VertexLitGeneric (vertexlit_and_unlit_generic_ps20b /
// vertexlit_and_unlit_generic_vs20) in the combos the native textured family
// cannot draw, which take the port: cube env maps (tint, contrast,
// saturation, masks, base alpha mask, self-illumination by the mask alpha),
// detail textures and blend modes, distance alpha (outline, soft edges, glow),
// seamless base and detail and the base-alpha tint blend, under vertex
// lighting (ambient cube, point, spot and directional lights, half-Lambert)
// and range fog. forced/ holds the combos the textured family draws. Quads are in clip space (identity
// transforms), so the eye is at the origin.
